desc: <<EOD
ETL Madness FlowUI (Flow Builder Studio) is an interactive .NET 10 ASP.NET Core
Blazor Server web application for visually designing, configuring, signing,
encrypting, validating, executing, and monitoring XML ETL pipelines powered by
go-flow and go-flowAPI. Installed isolated under /opt/flow-ui with FreeBSD rc.d
service integration (/usr/local/etc/rc.d/flow_ui).

Note: On FreeBSD, FlowUI is packaged as a framework-dependent .NET 10 app and
requires the FreeBSD dotnet runtime package (pkg install dotnet).
EOD
